Hi Heather,
For a very quick response: you would need buildDerivs=TRUE in your nimbleModel call. That might trigger more informative error trapping if there is something in the model not compatible with derivatives and hence HMC. If that doesn't make it clearer what is going on, hopefully someone can run your code soon and take a look.
Perry

