Hi Frédéric,

Given the issue seems to be with `clearCompiled`, I think this is probably a different seg fault than the other users were reporting. For the other users the seg fault seemed to occur in the course of the HMC sampling.

As I think we discussed in a separate thread, `clearCompiled` is somewhat experimental, but I think you had good reason to use it for your package, so it's unfortunate it is not as stable as we'd like.

To be honest, I doubt that trying to figure out the issue with `clearCompiled` can be a high priority for us. We are working on changes to the nimble compiler that will change completely how we do compilation and make problems with `clearCompiled` be no longer relevant.

-chris

